		<string text="Host and join games over the internet by invite\nlinks; off keeps to the local network."/>
		<string text="Let internet play ask the router to forward its\nport, for networks that stop connections."/>
		<string text="An invite link copied before switching to the\ngame: ask to join its game, always join, or not."/>
		<string text="Look for a new version when the game starts."/>
		<string text="In multiplayer, whose names are drawn above their\nheads."/>
		<string text="How large the players' names are drawn."/>
		<string text="A team game's scoreboard: a column for each team,\nor every player in order of score."/>
		<string text="Draw a panel behind the scoreboard, for clearer\ntext."/>
		<string text="A Custom Edition map a game needs, from the\ncommunity map repository: ask first, or not."/>
		<string text="What Discord shows: the game, map and score, only\nPlaying Chupathingy, or nothing."/>
		<string text="Show the name of the network game on Discord."/>
		<string text="While hosting a public game, Discord shows a Join\ngame button that opens its invite."/>
